namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget
    src   "Base class for almost all UI related things."
    text  "DreamGUI 的基类，适用于绝大多数 UI 相关控件。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:AddChild {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:AddChild
    src   "UMG's UPanelWidget::AddChild, adapted. UMG needs eight typed variants because each panel has\nits own slot class; here there is one UDreamPanelSlot, so one verb returns it and you can set\npadding straight off the result.\n\nReturns the child's slot, or null -- which means one of two very different things, so check\nthe child's parent if you need to tell them apart: a parent with no layout container takes\nchildren happily and simply has no slots to give (UMG cannot even express this), whereas a\nrefusal leaves the child exactly where it was. Refusals are a full panel, a cycle, or null.\n\nPassing a child this widget already owns is a reorder: the slot and everything on it survive,\nmatching what dragging a widget within one panel in the editor does."
    text  "改编自 UMG 的 UPanelWidget::AddChild。UMG 需要八个带类型的变体，因为每个面板都有\n自己的插槽类；而这里只有一个 UDreamPanelSlot，所以一个动词就返回它，你可以直接\n从结果上设置 padding。\n\n返回子项的插槽，或 null —— 它意味着两种截然不同的事情之一，因此若要区分，请检查\n子项的父项：没有布局容器的父项乐于接收子项，只是没有插槽可给（UMG 甚至\n无法表达这一点），而拒绝则会让子项完全留在原处。拒绝的情形是：面板已满、\n形成循环，或为 null。\n\n传入此控件已经拥有的子项即为重排：插槽及其上的一切都会保留，\n与在编辑器中同一面板内拖动控件的行为一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:AnchorData {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:AnchorData
    src   "AnchorData contains rect transform and color // DreamGUI_Hidden: the Layout section's anchor, position and size rows edit it."
    text  "AnchorData 包含矩形变换和颜色 // DreamGUI_Hidden：布局部分的锚点、位置和尺寸行会编辑它。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:AnimatableWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:AnimatableWidth
    src   "Animatable mirrors of the resolved geometry, one per channel Sequencer can key. Sequencer\nreads property memory directly while writing through the setter (the RelativeRotationEuler\nstory), so each must be a real stored field; SyncAnimatableGeometryMirrors keeps them equal\nto the caches below. A stale cache and its mirror go stale together, which is exactly what\nthe details panel shows too.\n        // DuiHidden on all six: they are Interp mirrors of AnchorData for Sequencer, and their setters\n// write through to it -- which is exactly what exempts them from the transient refusal and\n// exactly why a reflective sweep must not spell them: AnchorData already carries the value. DreamGUI_Hidden for the\n// same reason: the Layout section's rows edit the value."
    text  "已解析几何的可动画镜像，Sequencer 能打关键帧的每个通道各一个。Sequencer\n在通过 setter 写入的同时直接读取属性内存（RelativeRotationEuler\n那段缘由），因此每个都必须是真正存储的字段；SyncAnimatableGeometryMirrors 让它们保持\n与下面的缓存一致。陈旧的缓存与它的镜像会一同过期，这正是\n细节面板所显示的样子。\n        // 六个全部标了 DuiHidden：它们是 AnchorData（锚点数据）供 Sequencer 使用的 Interp 镜像，其 setter\n// 会写回 AnchorData —— 这正是它们免于临时拒绝的原因，也\n// 正是反射扫描绝不应列出它们的原因：AnchorData 已经持有该值。DreamGUI_Hidden 出于\n// 同样的原因：布局部分的行会编辑该值。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:AnnounceAccessibleText {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:AnnounceAccessibleText
    src   "Sends text through Slate's platform accessibility announcement channel."
    text  "通过 Slate 的平台无障碍播报通道发送文本。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:bClipToBelow {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:bClipToBelow
    src   "Shows this widget and everything under it only where the layer below it is drawn, and through that layer's opacity:\na clipping mask. The layer below is the sibling drawn before this one that does not clip to the layer below itself,\nso siblings that clip to the layer below in a row share one. It can be a simple or nine-sliced image or texture, or\na rect block; anything else is not clipped to, with a warning. A hidden layer below hides this too."
    text  "仅在其下方图层被绘制的位置显示此控件及其下所有内容，并透过该图层的透明度显示：\n一个裁剪遮罩。下方图层是在此控件之前绘制的、自身不裁剪到其下方图层的同级项，\n因此一排中裁剪到下方图层的同级项共享同一个。它可以是简单或九宫格切的图像或纹理，或\n矩形块；其他任何内容都不会被裁剪到，并会给出警告。下方的图层隐藏时，此控件也会隐藏。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:bIgnoreLayout {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:bIgnoreLayout
    src   "Ignore parent layout container"
    text  "忽略父级布局容器"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:bIsEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:bIsEnabled
    src   "UMG's bIsEnabled: the switch a game flips to grey a thing out and stop it responding.\n\nIt is a SECOND question from Interactable, not a rename of it. Interactable is three-valued and\ninheritable and describes how a widget joins the hierarchy's interaction policy; this is one\nbool a caller sets on the widget it is disabling, and it wins over everything below: a child\nthat asked for Interactable=Enabled is still disabled when an ancestor is disabled, which is\nwhat \"disable this dialog\" has to mean and what UMG's SetIsEnabled does.\n\nThe two are AND-ed. GetInteractableInHierarchy -- what input, navigation and the selectables'\ndisabled look all read -- answers true only when this widget and every ancestor are enabled AND\nthe Interactable rules say so, so every control's existing disabled appearance works through\nthis without a line of per-control code."
    text  "UMG 的 bIsEnabled：游戏用来把某物置灰并停止其响应的开关。\n\n它与 Interactable 是两个不同的问题，并非其重命名。Interactable 是三值的、\n可继承的，描述控件如何加入层级的交互策略；而这个是一个\nbool，由调用者在其正在禁用的控件上设置，并且它压过下面的一切：一个\n请求了 Interactable=Enabled 的子项，在祖先被禁用时仍处于禁用状态，这正是\n“禁用此对话框”必须表达的含义，也正是 UMG 的 SetIsEnabled 所做的。\n\n两者是 AND 关系。GetInteractableInHierarchy —— 输入、导航以及可选项的\n禁用外观都读取它 —— 只有在当前控件及所有祖先都已启用，并且\nInteractable 规则允许时才回答 true，因此每个控件的现有禁用外观都能通过\n它生效，而无需一行逐控件代码。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:bIsTabStop {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:bIsTabStop
    src   "Tab and Shift+Tab stop here, when it is focusable and can be navigated to. Off leaves it to the arrows, the pad, a\npointer and code -- a browser's tabindex=\"-1\"."
    text  "当可聚焦且可导航到时，Tab 和 Shift+Tab 会停在这里。关闭后会交给方向键、摇杆、\n指针和代码 —— 相当于浏览器的 tabindex=\"-1\"。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:bPerspective {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:bPerspective
    src   "PERSPECTIVE, in the shape CSS uses.\n\nTurning this on establishes a perspective for this widget's DESCENDANTS: children with depth\nare foreshortened toward an eye standing in front of this widget's plane, at whatever distance\nPerspectiveFieldOfView works out to.\nThe declaring widget itself is not moved -- the remap fixes its plane pointwise -- so switching\nit on never disturbs an interface that has no depth in it yet.\n\nThere is no \"inherit\" setting because inheritance is what happens by default: everything below\na scope is inside it. A descendant that declares its own perspective NESTS rather than\noverriding, exactly as nested CSS perspectives do.\n\nIt costs nothing when off, and nothing for a subtree whose widgets have no depth: the remap\nonly touches the depth direction, so a flat widget comes back bit for bit."
    text  "透视，沿用 CSS 的形式。\n\n开启后将为当前控件的后代建立一个透视：带深度的子项\n会朝着站在当前控件平面前方的一只眼睛产生透视缩短，距离由\nPerspectiveFieldOfView 计算得出。\n声明它的控件本身不会被移动 —— 重映射在其平面上逐点固定它 —— 所以开启\n它永远不会干扰尚无深度的界面。\n\n没有“继承”设置，因为继承本就是默认行为：一个作用域之下的所有内容\n都在其中。声明自己透视的后代会嵌套而不是\n覆盖，正如嵌套的 CSS 透视那样。\n\n关闭时没有开销，对控件都没有深度的子树也没有：重映射\n只触及深度方向，因此扁平控件会逐位原样返回。"
    state machine
}

