    src   "Detach and destroy a child, and everything below it. Use this when you are finished with it.\n\"Destroy\" is DestroyWidget's sense of the word: IsValid(InChild) answers false afterwards."
    text  "分离并销毁一个子控件及其所有子控件。当您完成使用时，请使用此功能。\n“销毁”是指 DestroyWidget 的销毁含义：IsValid(InChild) 将返回 false。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:DestroyWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:DestroyWidget
    src   "Tear this widget and its whole subtree down: unregister, detach from the parent, end play, and\nmark every widget in it as garbage.\n\nIsValid() therefore answers false from here, which is what the plugin's several hundred IsValid\nchecks were all written to mean. The memory itself still goes at the next collection; what\nchanges is that nothing can mistake a torn-down widget for a live one in the meantime.\n\nTwo things are deliberately NOT marked, both in DestroyWidget's own tail: anything reached while\na collection is running (BeginDestroy calls this from inside one), and anything rooted. Undo\nsurvives because each widget is Modify()'d before it is marked, so the transaction records the\ntransition and reverses it -- see the note on the loop."
    text  "拆毁此控件及其整个子树：取消注册、从父级分离、结束播放，并\n把其中的每个控件都标记为垃圾。\n\n因此此后 IsValid() 返回 false，这正是该插件数百处 IsValid\n检查当初写下时所表达的含义。内存本身仍会在下一次回收时释放；\n变化在于，在此期间没有任何东西会把已拆毁的控件误认为存活控件。\n\n有两类东西被刻意不标记，都位于 DestroyWidget 自身的收尾处：在回收运行期间\n触及的任何东西（BeginDestroy 会从回收过程中调用它），以及任何被根引用（rooted）的东西。撤销\n之所以有效，是因为每个控件在标记前都会先 Modify()，这样事务会记录这次\n转变并将其反转——参见循环处的说明。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:DisplayName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:DisplayName
    src   "This is useful when you need to find child UI element by name, use function \"FindChildByDisplayName\" or \"FindChildArrayByDisplayName\" to do it.\nMostly the displayName is the same as Actor's ActorLabel. If you want to change it, just change the actor label( Actor's name in world outliner).\nIf Actor's ActorLabel start with \"//\", then the \"//\" will be ignored.\nActorLabel is only valid in editor, but this is also valid on runtime."
    text  "当你需要按名称查找子UI元素时很有用，可使用函数\"FindChildByDisplayName\"或\"FindChildArrayByDisplayName\"来完成。\n大多数情况下displayName与Actor的ActorLabel相同。若要更改它，只需更改actor标签（Actor在世界大纲中的名称）。\n如果Actor的ActorLabel以\"//\"开头，则\"//\"将被忽略。\nActorLabel仅在编辑器中有效，但此名称在运行时同样有效。"
    state machine
}

