DreamWidget:HasPerspectiveApplied {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:HasPerspectiveApplied
    src   "True when a scope shapes THIS widget's own geometry -- its own declaration or an ancestor's.\nA widget is inside its own perspective: the scope's plane is taken from where layout put the\nwidget, so its own render rotation is measured against that plane and foreshortens like\nanything else. A widget with no render transform is flat in that plane and comes back\nuntouched, so switching Perspective on still changes nothing until something gains depth."
    text  "当某个作用域塑造了此控件自身的几何形状时返回 true——无论是其自身的声明还是祖先的声明。\n控件位于自身的透视之内：作用域的平面取自布局放置该\n控件的位置，因此其自身的渲染旋转是相对于该平面测量的，并像其他任何东西一样\n产生透视缩短。没有渲染变换的控件在该平面内是平的，会原样返回，\n因此在有东西获得深度之前，开启 Perspective 仍然不会有任何变化。"
    state machine
}

