DreamWidget:Parent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:Parent
    src   "Parent in hierarchy -- a back-pointer derived from the owning widget's Children, never a record\nof its own. DuplicateTransient as well as Transient: copying it would point a duplicated subtree\nat the ORIGINAL's parent, and the copy is rebuilt from Children anyway\n(RestoreParentLinksRecursive), which is the same pass a package load and class-template\ninstancing already have to run."
    text  "层级中的父项——由所属控件的 Children 派生出的反向指针，从不是自身的\n记录。同时标记 DuplicateTransient 与 Transient：复制它会让被复制的子树\n指向原件的父项，而副本本来就会从 Children 重建\n（RestoreParentLinksRecursive），这与包加载和类模板\n实例化本来就必须执行的是同一趟处理。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:PerspectiveFieldOfView {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:PerspectiveFieldOfView
    src   "The angle the subtree is viewed through, in degrees. Wider is a stronger effect, and it means\nexactly what UDreamCanvas::FieldOfView means -- the eye distance is derived from it with the\nsame formula, against this widget's own width.\n\nAn angle and not a distance, because a widget gets stretched: a distance stays put while the\nwidget grows around it, so the same prefab would look half as deep at twice the size. An angle\nis scale-invariant, the way a lens is -- filling more of the frame does not change the lens."
    text  "观察子树所用的角度，单位为度。角度越大效果越强，其含义\n与 UDreamCanvas::FieldOfView 完全一致——眼睛距离用同一公式\n基于此控件自身的宽度由它推导得出。\n\n用角度而非距离，是因为控件会被拉伸：距离固定不变，而控件\n围绕它变大，因此同一预制体在尺寸加倍时会看起来只有一半深。角度\n具有缩放不变性，就像镜头一样——占据更多画面并不会改变镜头。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:PerspectiveOrigin {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:PerspectiveOrigin
    src   "Where the eye stands over this widget's own rect, normalized: (0,0) bottom-left, (1,1)\ntop-right, matching RenderTransformPivot. The CSS `perspective-origin`, and the vanishing\npoint a subtree converges toward."
    text  "眼睛在此控件自身矩形上的位置，已归一化：(0,0) 为左下，(1,1)\n为右上，与 RenderTransformPivot 所表示的枢轴点一致。即 CSS 的 `perspective-origin`，也是子树汇聚的\n消失点。"
    state machine
}

