DreamWidget:RelativeRotation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:RelativeRotation
    src   "Local space rotation.\nNot marked Interp: Sequencer has no property track for FQuat, so this cannot be keyed\ndirectly. Animate RelativeRotationEuler instead, which mirrors this value.\n        // DuiHidden: RelativeRotationEuler is the authored face of this value, and a quaternion has no\n// spelling -- but FQuat is an ordinary struct, so without the tag a reflective sweep would\n// recurse it and write X/Y/Z/W component lines beside the euler it already wrote."
    text  "局部空间旋转。\n未标记 Interp：Sequencer 没有 FQuat 的属性轨道，因此无法直接\n打关键帧。请改为对 RelativeRotationEuler 做动画，它镜像此值。\n        // DuiHidden：RelativeRotationEuler 是此值可供编辑的一面，而四元数没有\n// 书写形式——但 FQuat 是普通结构体，所以若没有该标记，反射扫描会\n// 递归它，并在已写入的欧拉角旁再写入 X/Y/Z/W 分量行。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:RelativeRotationEuler {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:RelativeRotationEuler
    src   "Local space rotation as euler angles, mirroring RelativeRotation so that rotation can be\nanimated: Sequencer has an FRotator property track but none for FQuat.\n\nTransient, because RelativeRotation stays the serialized source of truth. Sequencer reads\nproperty memory directly while writing through the setter, so this has to be a real stored\nfield kept in sync rather than a value derived on demand.\n        // DreamGUI_Hidden: the Layout section's rotation row edits it."
    text  "局部空间旋转，以欧拉角表示，镜像 RelativeRotation，以便旋转可以被\n动画化：Sequencer 有 FRotator 的属性轨道，但没有 FQuat 的。\n\n瞬态，因为 RelativeRotation 仍是序列化后的真值来源。Sequencer 直接读取\n属性内存，同时通过 setter 写入，因此这里必须是一个真正存储的\n字段并保持同步，而不是按需推导出的值。\n        // DreamGUI_Hidden：Layout 分区的旋转行会编辑它。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:RelativeScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:RelativeScale
    src   "Local space scale // DreamGUI_Hidden on this and RelativeLocation: the Layout section's position and scale rows edit them (Interp makes them editable)."
    text  "局部空间缩放 // 此属性与 RelativeLocation 上标记了 DreamGUI_Hidden：Layout 分区的位置行和缩放行会编辑它们（Interp 使它们可编辑）。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:RemoveChild {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:RemoveChild
    src   "Detach a child and leave it alive: still registered, subtree intact, ready to be added\nsomewhere else. It goes back to the not-yet-added state a freshly created widget is in, so it\ndraws nothing and its behaviours are disabled in the meantime -- which is what makes this the\nverb to pool with, and why a pooled widget still shows up as held rather than leaked.\n\nOwnership passes to you. Nothing else refers to the widget afterwards, so either add it\nsomewhere or DestroyChild it; dropping the last reference to a live widget is a leak the\nengine cannot clean up quietly.\n\nThe slot does not survive, matching UMG and matching what any other move between parents\ndoes. Set padding and friends again after re-adding."
    text  "分离子控件并让它保持存活：仍然注册，子树完好，随时可被添加到\n别处。它回到新建控件所处的尚未添加状态，因此在此期间\n不绘制任何内容，其行为也被禁用 —— 这正是它成为\n池化首选操作的原因，也是池化控件仍显示为被持有而非泄漏的原因。\n\n所有权转交给你。此后没有任何其他东西引用该控件，所以要么把它添加到\n某处，要么对其调用 DestroyChild；丢弃对一个存活控件的最后一个引用，是引擎\n无法悄悄清理的泄漏。\n\n插槽不会保留，与 UMG 一致，也与任何其他在父级之间移动的操作\n一致。重新添加后需要再次设置 padding 及相关属性。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:RemoveFromParent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:RemoveFromParent
    src   "Take THIS widget off whatever it is attached to, and stay alive -- UMG's RemoveFromParent, from\nthe child's side. Returns false when it was not attached to anything.\n\nThere was no way to write \"remove myself\" before: a widget could only be removed by its parent\n(RemoveChild) or by the screen subsystem, by name. A widget that is a tracked screen page goes\nout through the subsystem as well, so its name is freed rather than left pointing at a page\nthat is registered, alive and nowhere.\n\nIt leaves the widget in the not-yet-added state, exactly as RemoveChild does: nothing draws and\nits behaviours are disabled until it is added somewhere. Ownership passes to the caller -- add\nit somewhere or destroy it. To take a page off the screen AND destroy it, call\nUDreamScreenUISubsystem::RemoveFromViewport instead."
    text  "将此控件从它所附加的任何对象上取下，并保持存活 —— 相当于 UMG 的 RemoveFromParent，从\n子控件一侧发起。当它未附加到任何对象时返回 false。\n\n此前无法表达“移除我自己”：控件只能由其父级（RemoveChild）或屏幕子系统\n按名称移除。作为受跟踪屏幕页面的控件也会通过子系统\n移除，因此它的名称会被释放，而不会继续指向一个已注册、存活却无处\n所在的页面。\n\n它使控件处于尚未添加状态，与 RemoveChild 完全一样：不会绘制任何内容，\n其行为被禁用，直到它被添加到某处。所有权转交给调用方 —— 把它添加\n到某处或销毁它。若要将页面从屏幕视口中移除并销毁它，请改为调用\nUDreamScreenUISubsystem::RemoveFromViewport。"
    state machine
}

