DreamWidget:SetContentTint {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:SetContentTint
    src   "Tint everything drawn below this widget -- its descendants' visuals, never its own -- as UMG's content colour does\n(a border's ContentColorAndOpacity reaching its child, SCompoundWidget's ColorAndOpacity). Multiplied in linear\nspace, with every ancestor's, into each descendant visual's UDreamVisual::GetFinalColor; marks their colours dirty.\nWhite changes nothing."
    text  "对此控件之下绘制的所有内容着色——即其后代的可视元素，绝不包括自身——如同 UMG 的内容颜色那样\n（边框的 ContentColorAndOpacity（内容颜色和不透明度）传递到其子级，SCompoundWidget 的 ColorAndOpacity（颜色和不透明度））。在线性\n空间中与每个祖先的着色值相乘，写入每个后代可视元素的 UDreamVisual::GetFinalColor；并将其颜色标记为脏。\n白色不产生任何变化。"
    state machine
}

