    src   "The cursor to show while the pointer is over this widget. Default means \"no opinion\" and lets\nwhatever is underneath claim it, which is why there is no separate override flag here as there\nis in UMG -- DreamPointerPolicy::ResolveCursor walks the hover stack innermost first and takes\nthe first widget with an opinion."
    text  "指针位于此控件上时显示的光标。默认表示“不表态”，让\n下方的内容去认领它，这就是这里不像 UMG 那样另有一个覆盖标志的原因——\nDreamPointerPolicy::ResolveCursor 由内向外遍历悬停栈，取\n第一个有表态的控件。"
    state machine
}

