DreamWidget:SetIsEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:SetIsEnabled
    src   "Disable (or re-enable) this widget and everything under it: the subtree stops taking input and\nevery control in it takes on its disabled look, because both read GetInteractableInHierarchy\nand this is AND-ed into it.\n\nVirtual because UMG's is, so a control that has to do something extra when it is switched off\nhas the hook. An override must NOT repeat the UFUNCTION."
    text  "禁用（或重新启用）此控件及其下的所有内容：该子树不再接收输入，\n其中的每个控件都会呈现禁用外观，因为两者都读取\nGetInteractableInHierarchy（层级可交互性），而此值会与之进行 AND 运算。\n\n之所以是虚函数，是因为 UMG 的是虚函数，这样在关闭时需要额外做事的控件\n就有了钩子。重写时绝不能重复 UFUNCTION。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidget:SetIsFocusable {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:SetIsFocusable
    src   "Turning this off also gives up any focus the widget currently holds.\n\nIt was a bare assignment, which left a widget that can no longer ACCEPT focus still holding it:\nSetFocus refuses to hand it out, nothing else moves the selection, and the navigation cursor\nstays parked on a widget the user can no longer reach."
    text  "关闭此项还会放弃该控件当前持有的焦点。\n\n过去这里只是一次直接赋值，导致一个已无法接受焦点的控件仍然持有焦点：\nSetFocus 拒绝交出焦点，也没有别的什么会移动选中项，导航光标\n就一直停在一个用户再也无法到达的控件上。"
    state machine
}

