DreamWidget:WidgetGuid {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#DreamWidget:WidgetGuid
    src   "Stable identity across trees. See GetWidgetGuid for what it replaces and why.\n\nNeither Transient nor DuplicateTransient, and that is the mechanism rather than an oversight:\na preview widget is instanced with its authored counterpart as the archetype, and a class\narchetype is a duplicate of the authoring tree, so both arrive already carrying the id that\npairs them back. Only DuplicateSubtree, which makes a NEW widget, issues a fresh one."
    text  "跨树稳定的标识。有关它取代了什么以及原因，请参见 GetWidgetGuid。\n\n既不是 Transient 也不是 DuplicateTransient，这是机制而非疏忽：\n预览控件以创作版本为原型进行实例化，而类原型是创作树的副本，\n因此两者到达时都已携带将它们配对的 id。\n只有 DuplicateSubtree 会创建新控件，也只有它才会签发新的 id。"
    state machine
}

