EDreamLayoutInvalidation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#EDreamLayoutInvalidation
    src   "What kind of change a layout invalidation is reporting.\n\nBlink's StyleDifference in miniature. There the decision is made once, by diffing the old and new\nComputedStyle, rather than by asking every setter to remember what it affects; the shape here is the\nsame even though the diff is not, and the point is identical - \"something changed\" and \"the desired\nsize changed\" are different facts and cost very different amounts of work.\n\nMeasure is the safe answer and the default, so a site that says nothing keeps the old behaviour."
    text  "布局失效所报告的是哪一种变更。\n\nBlink 的 StyleDifference 的缩影。在那里，决定只做一次，方式是比对新旧\nComputedStyle，而不是要求每个 setter 记住自己影响什么；此处的形态\n相同，尽管比对方式不同，要点则完全一致——“有东西变了”与“期望\n尺寸变了”是不同的事实，耗费的工作量也大不相同。\n\nMeasure 是安全答案，也是默认值，因此不作声明的站点保持原有行为。"
    state machine
}

EDreamLayoutInvalidation.Arrange {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#EDreamLayoutInvalidation:Arrange
    src   "Only where this widget sits inside its parent changed. Panels measure their children by desired\nsize and never by position, so nothing above the parent can produce a different answer - the\nparent re-arranges and the walk stops there."
    text  "仅此控件在其父项中的位置发生了变化。面板按期望尺寸测量子项，\n从不按位置测量，因此父项之上不可能得出不同的结果——\n父项重新排列，遍历就此停止。"
    state machine
}

EDreamLayoutInvalidation.Measure {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidget.h#EDreamLayoutInvalidation:Measure
    src   "This widget's desired size may have changed. Every ancestor that measures it has to re-run, so\nthe whole chain is dirtied. Text, sprites, child count, anything authored about size."
    text  "此控件的期望尺寸可能已改变。每个测量它的祖先控件都必须重新运行，因此\n整条链都被标记为脏。文本、精灵、子项数量，任何与尺寸相关的设置。"
    state machine
}

